  - m_Id: 25345767223844864
    m_Localized: "Acepto los <b>Terminos de Servicio</b> y la <b>Pol\xEDtica de Privacidad</b>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25351728189661184
    m_Localized: Terminos y Condiciones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25351921299611648
    m_Localized: '<b>Terminos y Condiciones de FOODMISSION</b>


      By using this
      application, you agree to the following terms:


      <b>1. ACCOUNT REGISTRATION</b>

      You
      must provide accurate and complete information when registering. You are responsible
      for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.


      <b>2.
      PRIVACY</b>

      We collect and process your personal data according to our
      Privacy Policy. This includes nutritional data, location information, and usage
      statistics.


      <b>3. DATA USAGE</b>

      Your data will be used to provide
      personalized nutritional recommendations and improve our services.


      <b>4.
      SECURITY</b>

      You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized access
      to your account.


      <b>5. ACCEPTABLE USE</b>

      You agree not to misuse
      the service or attempt unauthorized access.


      <b>6. TERMINATION</b>

      We
      reserve the right to terminate accounts that violate these terms.


      For
      more information, contact us at support@foodmission.eu'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
